#28201
King~
The King~
(Regal Aura) The King rests here.
~
The King rests here looking regal and wise. His benevolent smile warms
the room and he radiates compassion as his glance sweeps the room. The
sunken lines in his face have added to his stately appearance.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 80d80+4800 6d6+80
15001 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>fight_prog 100~
 rescale 28201 $n 165
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
 if quest(0,2,$n) <= 1
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
   smile $n
   break
  else
   mpecho The King coughs and excuses himself quietly.
   mpmset $n quest 0 2 1
   mpmset $n quest 32 2 1
  endif
 else
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 3
   says Hello again, $n.
  else
   tell $n Have you come to collect your REWARD, $n?
  endif
 endif
 if quest(2,2,$n) <= 1
  if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
   if quest(10,5,$n) == 25
    mpecho The King looks up in surprise.
    mpecho The King smiles like a child and engulfs the Prophet in an hug.
    mpechoat $n The King looks back at you and winks.
    mpechoaround $n The King looks at $n and winks.
    say It's so good to see you again. Both of you!
    chuckle
    mpecho {030}The Prophet says '$n, thank you very much.'{300}
    mpecho {030}The Prophet says 'We both owe you a great debt.'{300}
    mpecho The King nods in agreement.
    mpecho {030}The Prophet says 'Will you accept a GIFT from both of us?'{300}
    mpmset $n quest 2 2 2
    mpmset $n quest 10 5 0
   else
    smile $n
   endif
  endif
 else
  if quest (2,2,$n) == 3
   smile $n
   says Hello my friend, $n.
   bow $n
  else
   tell $n You forgot to collect your GIFT last time.
  endif
 endif
~
>give_prog i28200~
 if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 15
   mpechoat $n The King looks at you suddenly.
   mpechoaround $n The King looks at $n.
   say What! Is this what I think it is?
   mpechoat $n The King looks at you expectantly.
   mpechoaround $n The King looks at $n expectantly.
   break
  endif
  mpquiet on
   cast 'giant strength' $n
   give i28200 $n
  mpquiet off
  mpechoat $n The King returns the bottle.
  mpechoaround $n The King gives $n a bottle.
 endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
   if quest(10,5,$n) == 15
    mpechoat $n The King grins at you.
    mpechoaround $n The Kings grins at $n.
    mpecho The King takes a swig from the bottle.
    mpecho The King sighs in appreciation.
    mpecho {030}The King says 'You have no idea how good that feels!'{300}
    mpechoat $n The King claps you on your back.
    mpechoaround $n The King claps $n on the back.
    say Thank you so very much $n.
    say May the Prophet watch over you.
    mpechoat $n The King looks around for something to give you.
    mpechoaround $n The King looks around searching for something.
    tell $n Would you accept some kind of reward?
    mpjunk all
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
    mpmset $n quest 2 2 1
    mpmset $n quest 10 5 0
   endif
  endif
  if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
   if quest(10,5,$n) == 16
    mpecho The King shakes his head in wonder.
    mpechoat $n The King smiles at you.
    mpechoaround $n The King smiles at $n.
    say It is good to discover my old friend still lives.
    say He once told me that if a traveller gave me this
    say seal, then I am to reveal the hidden passageway.
    say May the Prophet watch over you, my friend.
    mpechoat $n The King presses a button and you slide down a chute.
    mpechoaround $n The King presses a hidden button.
    mpechoaround $n $n slides down a chute and disappears!
    mpechoat $n You land heavily on the ground, somewhat stunned.
    mpjunk all
    mpmset $n quest 10 5 17
    mptransfer $n 28259
    tell $n You can ask to return there at any time, $n.
   endif
  endif
~
>speech_prog return~
  if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
   if quest(10,5,$n) == 17
    mpechoat $n The King presses a button and you slide down a chute.
    mpechoaround $n The King presses a hidden button.
    mpechoaround $n $n slides down a chute and disappears!
    mpechoat $n {000}You land heavily on the ground, somewhat stunned.{300}
    mptransfer $n 28259
   endif
  endif
~
>give_prog i28203~
 if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 15
   mpecho The King gasps suddenly.
   say Is this what I think it is?
   mpmset $n quest 10 5 16
   mpquiet on
    mpjunk i28203
   mpquiet off
  endif
 endif
~
