#28206
gypsy~
The Gypsy~
(Wise Aura) The Gypsy roams here.
~
The Gypsy.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 80d80+4800 6d6+80
15006 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>fight_prog 99~
 rescale 28206 $n 165
~
>speech_prog prophet~
 if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 5
   say He's alive I tell you!
   mpmset $n quest 10 5 6
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog alive~
 if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 6
   say Yes! He's alive! I have a parchment here with his
   say seal clearly visible on red wax.
   mpecho The Gypsy searches her belongings for a while.
   mpmset $n quest 10 5 7
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog parchment~
 if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 7
   say It appears I've misplaced it. I bet one of the others have
   say picked it up on their travels.
   sigh
   say You will bring it back to me if you find it I hope.
   mpmset $n quest 10 5 8
  endif
 endif
~
>give_prog i28209~
 if quest(2,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(10,5,$n) == 8
   mpecho The Gypsy studies the parchment for a while.
   say This is it!
   say Thank you for returning this.
   mpecho The Gypsy peels off the seal.
   say Take this as a token of thanks.
   mpmset $n quest 10 5 9
   mpquiet on
    cast 'giant strength' $n
    mpoload 28203
    give i28203 $n
    drop i28203
    mpjunk all
   mpquiet off
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy gives you a fragile seal of wax.
   mpechoaround $n The Gypsy gives $n a fragile seal of wax.
  else
   mpquiet on
    drop i28209
   mpquiet off
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy carelessly drops the parchment.
   mpechoaround $n The Gypsy carelessly drops the parchment.   
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog midnight~
 if quest(20,3,$n) == 4
  say Hmm? Midnight you say?
  mpechoat $n The Gypsy grins toothlessly at you.
  mpechoaround $n The Gypsy grins at $n.
  say Don't go out tonight... there's bound to be a fight...
  say There's a bad moon on the rise!
  cackle
  say You kept our bargain, and here is your salt.
  mpquiet on
   cast 'giant strength' $n
   mpoload 28281
  mpquiet off
  give i28281 $n
  drop i28281
  mpjunk all
  mpmset $n quest 20 3 5
 endif
~
>speech_prog salt~
 if quest(20,3,$n) == 2
  say Hmm? Salt you say? That's right... you wanted some salt.
  mpechoat $n The Gypsy grins toothlessly at you.
  mpechoaround $n The Gypsy grins at $n.
  say How about you deliver this note to the nice young guard
  say in the Castle and then come back and see me. I'll have
  say some salt for you by then I'm sure.
  mpquiet on
   cast 'giant strength' $n
   mpoload 28283
  mpquiet off
  give i28283 $n
  drop i28283
  mpjunk all
  mpmset $n quest 20 3 3
 endif
 if quest(20,3,$n) == 1
  say Hmm? Salt you say? You want know if I have some salt?
  mpechoat $n The Gypsy searches her belongings for a while then forgets about you.
  mpechoaround $n The Gypsy searches her belongings for a while.
  mpmset $n quest 20 3 2
 endif
~
