Wearing an old colorful shirt, and gold chain. He peers around himself
looking for something... or so it seems.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
40 0 0 35d30+100 6d7+10
15029 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 10~
 mpecho The Gypsy mumbles something to himself.
~
>speech_prog trade~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 2
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy looks you up and down.
   say What makes you think you think I have anything to trade?
   mpmset $n quest 16 4 3
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog quartermaster scribe master~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 3
   chuckle
   say I have some items that might be of interest to you.
   say What were you looking for?
   mpmset $n quest 16 4 4
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog vellum~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 4
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy nods to himself and starts rummaging.
   say Ahh. Here we are... the finest quality Chakkorian
   say Vellum. You can't get better quality anywhere else
   say in the Realm! I can see you are an honest trader.
   say How about something to keep me warm over the winter...
   say Blankets? Some blankets, a knife and some beads.
   say Bring me those and we have a deal!
   mpmset $n quest 16 4 5
  endif
 endif
~
>give_prog i28218~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 7
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy nods to you and admires the beads.
   if hasobjnum(28218)
    if hasobjnum(28219)
     if hasobjnum(28220)
      say You are indeed someone who knows the value of trading.
      mpquiet on
       mpoload 28221
       cast 'giant strength' $n
       give i28221 $n
       drop i28221
       mpjunk all
      mpquiet off
      mpechoat $n The Gypsy bundles the Vellum up and hands it to you.
      say See you again soon $n.
      mpecho The Gypsy wanders off.
      mpmset $n quest 16 4 8
      mpgoto 28271
     endif
    endif
   endif
  endif
 endif
~
>give_prog i28219~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 7
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy nods to you and examines the blankets.
   if hasobjnum(28218)
    if hasobjnum(28219)
     if hasobjnum(28220)
      say You are indeed someone who knows the value of trading.
      mpquiet on
       mpoload 28221
       cast 'giant strength' $n
       give i28221 $n
       drop i28221
       mpjunk all
      mpquiet off
      mpechoat $n The Gypsy bundles the Vellum up and hands it to you.
      say See you again soon $n.
      mpecho The Gypsy wanders off.
      mpmset $n quest 16 4 8
      mpquiet on
       goto 28271
      mpquiet off
     endif
    endif
   endif
  endif
 endif
~
>give_prog i28220~
 if quest(4,2,$n) == 1
  if quest(16,4,$n) == 7
   mpechoat $n The Gypsy nods to you and tests the knife edge.
   say Not as sharp as I would have liked, but it'll do.
   if hasobjnum(28218)
    if hasobjnum(28219)
     if hasobjnum(28220)
      say You are indeed someone who knows the value of trading.
      mpquiet on
       mpoload 28221
