#28251
quartermasterquestmobeth~
The Quartermaster Master Ethereal~
(Official Aura) The Quartermaster is fading here.~
This mob makes it a little more difficult for those without the source
area file to figure out some of the mob speechprogs.~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_WEAK
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_ETHEREAL|AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_DETECT_INVIS 
0 S
1 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+10 1d1+6
1 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>speech_prog business chat~
 if quest(23,3,$n) == 0
  mpechoat $n The Quartermaster looks you up and down for a moment.
  mpechoaround $n The Quartermaster leers at $n for a while.
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'Let's come straight to the point shall we $n?'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'I'm looking for anything that I can sell. The Gypsies'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'are always interested in buying things from me, but'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'the most profitable items are a little more exotic.'{300}
  mpecho The Quartermaster chuckles to himself for a time.
  mpmset $n quest 23 3 1
 endif
~
>speech_prog exotic~
 mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'Anything that offers an escape from reality for a time'{300}
 mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'always fetches the best price. Drugs have become a'{300}
 mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'very profitable line right at the moment. People are'{300}
 mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'enjoying the side effects of medicinal treatments more'{300}
 mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'and more nowadays... even if they are hallucinogenic.'{300}
~
>speech_prog hallucinogenic~
 if quest(23,3,$n) == 1
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'Mushrooms, Toadstools even some smaller animals are'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'known to create a change in people's state of mind.'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'If you can get me something like this, then I will'{300}
  mpecho {030}The Quartermaster says 'reward you handsomely.'{300}
  mpmset $n quest 23 3 2
 endif
~
