the edges of the seal you can see an inscription.~
ITEM_TYPE_TRASH
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE
0 0 0 0
0 28203 1
E
inscription edges edge~
The runes are carefully imprinted in the wax...

 d n n n w w w s s e s e n n w w s s w u

They are obviously directions to something. Maybe buried treasure?
You also notice the prominent name of the owner: 'STASIS'.
~
E
treasure~
