 d n n n n w w s s e e e e n n w w s s u
~
P 1
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 stasis
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = 28225 2 3
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO The world jumps sideways and you find yourself somewhere else.~
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
mpgoto 28240 & mpmset $ questr 28200 26 4 0~
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You feel the seal vibrate for a moment, then nothing.~
P 4
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 sisats
